<title>GREECE: UPDATE: ATHENS BOURSE TO TRADE 12:00-14:30 LOCAL.</title>
<headline>UPDATE: ATHENS BOURSE TO TRADE 12:00-14:30 LOCAL.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange will start trading at 12:00 local after a technical problem delayed its normal opening at 10:45 local, bourse officials told Reuters.</p>
<p>The session will end at 14:30 local.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
